  "notes": "ILABS pinout, 'Board: Challenger RP2040 SubGHz' (RFM69HCW module), 98-00237-1 V0.1. Labels are the orange 'RP2040 GPIO pins' callouts (ADC0-ADC3 on A0-A3) or power/control callouts; silkscreen spelling first in functions, then callouts outward. Legend: '* = Digital I/O, not Analog inputs on this board' (A4*, A5*). Skipped: USB-C, LiPo battery connector (Battery +/- only), U.FL antenna, RFM69 module castellations (unlabeled), buttons, LEDs."
